# What lumen must not index. Same syntax as .gitignore.
#
# The three portable bundles are GENERATED copies of scripts/, hooks/, skills/ and agents/ —
# `scripts/build_portable.py` writes them. Indexing them means every semantic search returns
# the same file three or four times over.
#
# Measured on this repo before this file existed: a search for the code that stamps the
# approval time put `scripts/tdq_state.py` outside the top 8, because duplicates from the
# bundles took the slots. With the bundles excluded the same query ranks it 1st, and a second
# phrasing ranks it 4th.
portable_claude/
portable_codex/
antigravity_portable/
portable_codex.zip

# Generated analysis output, not source anyone searches for.
graphify-out/
